), 2 gr cloves (kruidnagel), 2 gr nutmeg (nootmuskaat), 1 gr white peppercorn (witte peper), 1 gr ginger powder (gemberpoeder), \u00bd gr cardamom seeds (from the green pods) (kardemomzaadjes). Grind in a coffee grinder or mortar.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/63637139@N00\">FotoosVanRobin</a> from Netherlands","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}},"mime":"image/jpeg"}]}}}}